# SHE-SHIELD Project Rules

## Tech Stack & Architecture
- Backend: AWS Lambda (Python or Node.js) + Amazon API Gateway
- Database: Amazon DynamoDB (NoSQL) for fast case management and logging
- Geolocation: Amazon Location Service for tracking and hotspot monitoring
- AI / Pattern Correlation: Amazon Bedrock for analyzing missing-person reports and clustering case patterns
- Notifications: Amazon SNS for instant emergency alerts

## Coding & Hackathon Guidelines
- Keep Lambda functions modular, stateless, and lightweight.
- Always include robust JSON error handling for API responses.
- Use environment variables for all AWS table names, resource endpoints, and region configurations.
- Focus on building a functional MVP fast, keeping code clean and well-commented.
